{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "货与人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3286734f2e932911b1a08312465878687c3feb4ea0e315e1f8d457aaa80b65d5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一杯晌午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "好，尚师傅慢坐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "今天怎么上工这么迟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一早遇见了个老熟人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "什么熟人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哎呀，实在没想到今天又能见到师傅您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "怎么，还在找那什么凉亭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "有师傅替我划出范围，轻松不少，但我要找的，毕竟是人不是亭，还是有点难的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那边坐着的，是你情人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......什！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "咳，我还没那胆子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "哦，难不成是你女儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我哪像是为人父的样子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "倒也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，你刚刚说什么！我和这个龙门骗子是什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一对男女，在早春的这个时间登山，多半是闲得没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "尚师傅，晌午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "晌午茶？这还没到晌午吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "凡是在尚蜀山上行走的挑夫，都可以在山腰山脚的茶馆白喝两顿茶水。上午一顿晌午茶，下午一顿日落茶，各送些小菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "白喝的茶水，滋味总是不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "茶水罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可毕竟是在山上，山上的茶水，总是贵一些的。那既然是不要钱的，还是赚到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你倒是会算账。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "可店家真的这么好心？都是做慈善来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "当然是官府掏钱补贴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你懂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "家里也是做餐饮生意的，当然懂得多点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "尚蜀官府如此贴心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "梁大人上任之后一直如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "前几任尚蜀官员，兴建土木，开发山林，不仅让城市从百废待兴中恢复过来，而且变得更加生机勃勃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "到了梁洵梁大人这儿，兴许是认为尚蜀已经修葺一新，便把重心转移到安民厚民之上......这些事，无非是其中最细末的琐事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......年纪轻轻，懂得不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "家父从商，耳濡目染罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你有个好父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "茶喝完了，我也该走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "后会有期，尚师傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "后会有期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——喂！姓鲤的，酒盏怎么会在他身上！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不清楚。但他根本没有藏的意思，那么坦荡荡挂在腰上，就像是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "故意让人来找他似的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......罢了，我们也喝壶茶，静观其变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "小二！上两壶茶，两碗烂肉面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我不吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我吃两碗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "客官，这是两壶茶水，只是面要等等，今天人多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "多谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "怎么还跟到这里来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "呼......嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，姓鲤的，问你个事，你别笑话我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那茶壶，是不是自己在动......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "烂肉面来啦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "好险，差点摔一跤！客官留点神，我这还端着面呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷呜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "......这是个啥？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——喂，你没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那些锅碗瓢盆，布幌字画......都从房子里......跑出来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被吓到的客人",
      "text": "呀——！这是什么！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "火！火，这个怪物着了火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......它们是冲着我们来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，姓鲤的！这到底是怎么回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "原来关于那只酒盏的传闻竟然是真的......这里人多，先走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "怎么联系鲤小子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......鲤先生在信里留言，让我们会合之后，就去取江峰的山顶找他。如果他没到，就等他到日落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......好。我们抓紧吧，可不能让酒盏落入别人手里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人，之前那些与墨魉相似的幻灵，如何是好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "多半和那只酒盏有关......先去找鲤先生会合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷呜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人，它们，是不是，变多了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......？这是什么品种的野兽？这两天怎么总能见到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "被包围了呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唔，好凶好凶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "——没法子了！恩人，你和慎师傅先走，我来应付这些玩意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "——你没问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "和墨魉大抵差不多的路数，还算应付得来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "慎师傅！这边走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "怎么了，一副心神不宁的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你担心人的时候，总是皱着眉头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "有的，谁这么值得梁大人上心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我在担心我那位朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "他怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "他入了一个局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你让他入的局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你现在愧疚了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我还是相信这是最好的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是我不确定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "text": "你很聪明，梁大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "算不得聪明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是选了个笨法子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......大炎的野兽，都是长这样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......嗷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嗯？阿灯？啊，不要紧张啦......嗯，有你们陪着我就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "钻头！就这样抓住它！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "从没见过的炎国野兽啊......也许会成为出其不意的陷阱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "唉！怎么回事，我最近是命里犯鬼怪了吗，怎么成天要和这些稀奇古怪的生物作对的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "——唔哦！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "呜嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......定睛细看，这些东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "呜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "（糟糕——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......好险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "先生没受伤吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "你是，那天的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "勿问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "太合叔，不必这么生分......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......你们知道这些东西的来历？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "那只酒盏所过之处，器伥四起，反而证明了司岁台的猜测。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "这是不是说明......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子慎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......太合叔教训得是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "呜嗷——呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "（这些幻灵，呃，器伥......是在害怕这两个人？不，是在害怕这个少年......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "看看这些器伥，这样的事情发生过几次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "十年前一次，二十五年前一次，再前一甲子，仍有数次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "虽说偶有善使源石技艺的恶人闹事，情况也不比这好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "可岁终究是岁，兽终究是兽，你们若是有心为害天下，天知道会有多大的灾难？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "嗷——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "司岁台不想看到这样的事情发生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "所以我们要把这笔千年来的糊涂账算干净。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......不过是些残渣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "那些东西......变回普通器具了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "乌有先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "麻烦转告克洛丝姐姐，还请她再考虑考虑我所说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "买卖不成仁义在，哪怕最后克洛丝姐姐有自己的考量，那我这里，也有一个不论身份也想委托罗德岛的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "没问题是没问题，可那会儿你为什么不自己对恩人说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......哈哈，那会儿嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "有点紧张，话没说全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "那么......我们似乎也耽搁不起了，乌有先生，就此告辞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......紧张？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "带着一个副监察御史到处乱跑的公子哥，也会紧张的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
